== Acquisition ==
{{achievement list|reward=Chest of the Mists (rare)}}

== Contents ==
{{see|Chest of the Mists (rare)/historical|label=Historical drops}}
* Chance at an un-infused [[Ascended trinket|Ascended Ring]].
* Rare chance of a [[Gold Fractal weapons|Gold Fractal weapon skin]]
* Rare chance of an [[Ascended chest#List of ascended chests|Ascended Weapon Chest]]
* Rare chance of an [[Ascended chest#List of ascended chests|Ascended Armor Chest]]
* {{contains|Pristine Fractal Relic|chance=Guaranteed}}
* {{contains|1 Agony Infusion|+1 Agony Infusion|chance=Guaranteed}}
* {{contains|Writ of Experience|chance=Guaranteed}}
* {{contains|Fractal Encryption Key|qty=2|chance=Guaranteed}}
* {{contains|Stabilizing Matrix|chance=Guaranteed}}
* {{contains|Resonating Sliver|chance=Guaranteed}}

