== Trivia ==
* Added to the game with the [[Game updates/2014-12-16|December 16, 2014]] update, as part of the reworked daily achievement system.
* Chests of the Mists awarded for Daily Recommended Fractals were removed on [[Game updates/2016-04-19|April 19, 2016]], when the daily fractals were reworked.

